    "Id": "chassisdef_stalker_iv_STK-11B",
    "Name": "Stalker IV",
    "Details": "The most basic of the Stalker IV variants, the -11B just mounts the standard 275 fusion core, 18 double heat sinks and its weapons; two ER Large Lasers and two Light PPC with Twin-Linked Capacitors.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.43</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
