  "StockRole": "Heavy Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "The 170 ton Stalker IV superheavy 'Mech, or the SuperStalker as commonly known amongst MechWarriors, is the creation of the best minds at the Republic Institute for Strategic Combat (RISC). It is an attempt to convert the otherwise somewhat fragile Stalker to a true superheavy juggernaut, combining the experimental Superheavy Ferro-Alloy armor with a reinforced structure and a heavy duty gyro. All together this creates an extremely durable basis for the rest of the 'Mech, although limited in free space and available weight capacity.",
